SUMMARY:Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul (Sunday April 16th)
  
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us **on zoom** for a fun\, relaxing and inspiring evening with
  **Love Songs that Stir the Soul.**\n\nSongs that I have written for well 
 over 36 years.\nYou will love what you hear! :)\nWonderful and Beautufi ne
 w songs every week\, including some of our favorites!\n\n\\*You are welcom
 e to join us any time after 8:30 pm (Eastern Time)\n\\*You are also welcom
 e to come on later in the evening as well\n**\\*\\*Attend for free if you 
 like - if it's your first time attending :)**\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nS
 incerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Songwriter/Producer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:
 \n**Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul (Sunday April 5th) (Hap
 py Easter!)**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\n\\*Original Lyrics and Songs by Songwriter
  and Producer Steve Flemming\n\n\\*Story songs\, love songs\, spiritual so
 ngs\, songs about nature\, our culture\, our past\, our future\, relations
 hips and our lives\n\nI'll be playing a mix of songs using a fusion of mix
 ed genres like\, **Folk\, Traditional Folk\, Country\, Blue Grass\, Singer
  Song Writer\, Soft Rock\, Easy Listening\, Classic Rock\, R & B\, Gospel\
 , Pop\, Adult Contemporary\, Indie Rock/Po**p and many others genres too. 
 So please sit back and get ready to have an amazing auditory experience in
  the comforts of your own home :)\n\n\\*You can come on and off at any tim
 e during the night- starting at 8:30 pm\n\n**About Steve Flemming:**\nHigh
 ly influenced by the great singer songwriters of the 50s\, 60s\, 70s\, 80s
  and 90s. I have been writing my own songs since 1990. Songs about life\, 
 love\, loss\, hope\, faith\, joy\, romance\, memories\, spirituality and h
 eartbreak. Songs that are universal\, heartfelt and often relevant to the 
 lives of many others.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\n**Pay
  What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer or pay 
 pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribute is 
 greatly appreciated to help support this meaningful musical endeavor and s
 ong loving community\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\n\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495
 043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \n\n**Testimonials from Past Events:**\nYour songs are wonder-full\, speak
  to emotions\, experiences and moments we've all felt and lived. S. B.\nSt
 eve Flemming is an amazing songwriter whose lyrics stir the soul. He trans
 forms everyday thoughts and life into beautiful poetry and magical tunes. 
 Amazing stuff yet again Steve. - L.L.\nSteve\, thank you for a night of he
 artfelt\, exhilarating\, and inspiring music.\nV.R.\nThanks for having me 
 my friend. I love your words\, they calm me and energize me at the same ti
 me I'll look forward to your next invite\nM.Z.\nThese great songs definite
 ly helped me to decompress after a long day. Keep up the song writing Stev
 e\, these are great! - S.S.\nThank you so much for a relaxing evening and 
 sharing your inspiring music Steve! I am excited to hear more and I hope y
 ou do this again!! - C.B\nLovely songs and a great vibe with wonderful peo
 ple. I couldn’t have asked for a better way to close my day. Huge thanks
  Steve\, for inviting me! I truly enjoyed every moment! - N.A.\nThe lyrics
  are amazing. From the heart...\nThanks Steve for the amazing tunes. I'm t
 ruly blown away. Very glad I joined.\n\\- E\\.E\\.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-
